# Multi-agent protocol

## Session start

Read: `AGENTS.md` → `docs/STATUS.md` → last 5 `docs/HANDOFF.md` → `docs/07_TASKS.md` → `docs/agents/LOCKS.md` → ADRs + your role file.

## Claim

Pick TODO with deps DONE → one commit: Status=CLAIMED, Owner set, LOCKS row (24h) for `Touches`. Conflict → other task or BLOCKED.

## Execute

Branch `agent/<role>/<task-id>`; prefer worktree; stay inside `Touches`. Shared `Cargo.toml` / `vd-proto` = architect only.

## DoD

fmt + clippy `-D warnings` + tests; acceptance met; docs if needed; Status=REVIEW; release lock; append HANDOFF. Authors never mark DONE — reviewer does.

## Commits

Conventional Commits with task id: `feat(vd-net): … [T-0210]`

## Honesty

No fake DONE on stubs; no invented benches; append-only HANDOFF/ADRs.
